        "content": "<p>I'm looking for something like a combination of <a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/find/?pattern=OrderEmbedding#doc\">docs#OrderEmbedding</a> and <a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/find/?pattern=OrderAddMonoidHom#doc\">docs#OrderAddMonoidHom</a> (this isn't the same as just an injective <code>OrderAddMonoidHom</code>)</p>",
